# The result of the most recent local CI run. Evidence of a verification, not a verification —
# it records what happened on one machine at one moment, and committing it would invite a reader
# to trust a file instead of re-running the pipeline. The pipeline is cheap; the file is not
# authority.
artifacts/local-ci/

# This repository has no third-party dependencies, by the decision recorded in PROJECT.md. The
# entry is here so that an accidental `npm install` shows up as a missing check rather than as a
# committed tree.
node_modules/
